          "source_bid": "d59f2ofs2u4h",
          "details": "其年，除桂州刺史、桂管觀察使。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "office_id": "hixi5vx2iuj0",
      "text": "宣州刺史",
      "place_id": "hixicl83ncro",
      "sources": [
        {
          "title": "《舊唐書》卷一百二十六·陳少遊傳",
          "source_bid": "d59f2ofs2u4h",
